 "remarks": "Welcome to 2 Drumlin Road, a rare single-story ranch nestled in the desirable Compo Beach neighborhood of Westport. Set on a .29-acre parcel, this 4-bedroom, 2-full-bath home offers endless possibilities-move right in, renovate, or build your dream home.  Lovingly maintained by the same owners since 1973, the home features a cheerful kitchen with stainless steel appliances, a newer roof, siding, and windows, plus spacious front and back decks for outdoor enjoyment. The inviting front porch is ideal for relaxing in a rocking chair, while the expansive rear deck provides a great space for entertaining.  This hard-to-find ranch-style residence blends comfort, convenience, and opportunity in one of Westport's most sought-after locations-within walking distance to Old Mill and Compo Beach, and close to schools, town, and commuting options.",
